@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@shortCode = q0V

### Shorten a long URL
# @name shorten
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "longUrl": "https://example.com/some/very/long/path?query=1"
}

> {% client.global.set("shortCode", response.body.shortCode); %}

### Redirect to the original URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{shortCode}}
Referer: https://twitter.com
User-Agent: IntelliJ HTTP Client

### Fetch click stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/{{shortCode}}
